1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Turn personal Skills into governed AI capabilities the whole team can reuse.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The challenge is not calling a Tool. It is safe delivery and continuous change.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Validation, release, version pinning, and policy form one trusted loop.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Every MCP Tool enters with a version, risk class, and content digest.

5
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:06,000
One action resolves dependencies, builds, activates, and starts a durable run.

6
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Output: 32.4. Run, Release, and Generation remain traceable.

7
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Pass: activate atomically. Fail: keep the active Generation.

8
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Build once, reuse across the team. Releases are gated; failures keep the active version.

